Project Structure
Code Organization
knowledge/
├── src/                        # Main source code
│   ├── cli.ts                 # CLI interface
│   ├── generator.ts           # Documentation generator
│   ├── search.ts              # Search system
│   ├── markdown.ts            # Markdown processor
│   ├── config.ts              # Configurations and types
│   └── dev-server.ts          # Development server
├── themes/                     # Theme system
